WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Find a friend and send a request
A request becomes pending; the sender can cancel it.

2
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.000
The recipient chooses
Incoming requests can be declined without creating a friendship.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Accept from the notification inbox
The live inbox receives the request and resolves it when accepted.

4
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Open a conversation from a profile
Accepted friends can go directly from the profile to messaging.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.500
Send from desktop to mobile
Messages are persisted and arrive in the other session live.

6
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:45.000
Reply from the phone
The same conversation works with touch-sized controls on mobile.

7
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Keep the conversation after reload
A new page load retrieves the saved conversation.

8
00:00:52.500 --> 00:01:00.000
Manage saved notifications
Open a saved notification’s destination and dismiss a demonstration-only update.

9
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.500
Remove a newly added friendship
Cancel keeps the friend; confirm removes only the relationship created in this recording.

10
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:16.630
Mark individual and bulk notifications read
Live follow and reaction updates let the recipient mark one read, then resolve the remaining unread update.

11
00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:24.130
Dismiss only the new demo updates
Remove one saved update or clear the remaining inbox of this new demonstration account.
